  ],
  "proposedAgents": [],
  "extractedSignals": [
    "The EngiAI benchmark reveals that current LLM agents are not yet reliable for complex engineering workflows, particularly where conditional logic and sustained multi-step execution are required.",
    "For To Play Claw users building engineering or manufacturing agents, this paper provides the first rigorous benchmark to evaluate agent reliability across the full design-to-manufacturing pipeline, highlighting where current tools fail and where improvements are needed.",
    "Conditional branching is the single biggest weakness for LLM agents in engineering—models drop to 20-53% accuracy on complex problems",
    "RAG is not optional: retrieval-augmented scores are near-perfect while non-RAG scores are near-zero, validating the necessity of external knowledge",
    "Long-running HPC workflows expose a critical failure mode: instruction-following degrades significantly over multi-step pipelines"
  ],
